    "collapsible_content_FQDwUH": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_wdYWRb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the Big Rig Bundle?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The Big Rig Bundle is a limited-time deal built specifically for Skoolies, RVs, buses, and big van rigs. It includes everything you need for the ultimate outdoor setup: the spacious 12' x 9' MoonShade XL, a FREE set of MoonMount vacuum anchors for secure attachment to your rig.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xcQPRk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the Big Rig Bundle + MoonWall XL?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>This is a separate Back to Skoolie bundle deal with the MoonWall XL for added privacy, protection, and shade. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YPPpnA": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I get both deals?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Each deal already includes The MoonShade XL and MoonMounts. If you’re looking for a full shade setup including the MoonWall XL privacy wall, go with the Big Rig Bundle + MoomWall XL. If you just want the shade itself and the mounts, the Big Rig Bundle promo has you covered.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zxdadT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s the difference between the MoonMount Oval and Round?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Both MoonMounts deliver serious holding power, it just comes down to the shape of your rig. The MoonMount Round (4.5\") is perfect for wide, flat panels like vans, trucks, and SUVs. The MoonMount Oval (3\" × 5.87\") has a slimmer profile made for tight spots and narrow surfaces like Casitas, trailers, and ridged roofs. Same strength, different shape—pick what fits your setup best. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_iJhQWN": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do MoonMounts work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>MoonMounts are heavy-duty vacuum anchors that attach to almost any non-porous surface—no roof rack required. They offer strong, reliable hold without damaging your paint or paneling, and they make setup and takedown quick and tool-free. Whether you’re parking on a cliffside or at a campground, MoonMounts give your MoonShade a rock-solid foundation.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
